          "distinct": false,
          "id": "1c30d2902dde736b05bd01a22a1841c605bb093b",
          "message": "chore(deps): update rust crate mysql_common to 0.38.0 (#4843)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[mysql_common](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common)\n| workspace.dependencies | minor | `0.37.1` → `0.38.0` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>blackbeam/rust_mysql_common (mysql_common)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.38.2`](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/releases/tag/v0.38.2)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/compare/v0.38.1...v0.38.2)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- Fix `AuthSwitchRequest::plugin_data` again by\n[@&#8203;blackbeam](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam) in\n[#&#8203;194](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/pull/194)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/compare/v0.38.1...v0.38.2>\n\n###\n[`v0.38.1`](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/releases/tag/v0.38.1)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/compare/v0.38.0...v0.38.1)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- Fix `AuthSwitchRequest::plugin_data` by\n[@&#8203;blackbeam](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam) in\n[#&#8203;193](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/pull/193)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/compare/v0.38.0...v0.38.1>\n\n###\n[`v0.38.0`](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/releases/tag/v0.38.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/compare/v0.37.3...v0.38.0)\n\n#### Breaking\n\n- new `ChallengeResponsePlugin` trait was introduced to incapsulate the\nauth logic for suppoted plugins\n- every plugin now have its state machine in a separate module under\n`crate::auth::plugins`\n- New `AuthProc` enum was introduced as a convenient way for a driver to\ndispatch auth packets to a plugin\n- `AuthPluginData` was removed in favor of responses generated by\n`ChallengeResponsePlugin::run`\n\n#### PRs\n\n- Changes needed to support MariaDB \"Zero config SSL\" feature by\n[@&#8203;lawrinn](https://redirect.github.com/lawrinn) in\n[#&#8203;185](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/pull/185)\n- Support sha256_password auth plugin by\n[@&#8203;t8y2](https://redirect.github.com/t8y2) in\n[#&#8203;186](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/pull/186)\n\n#### Other changes\n\nCrate-level docs was moved to `CRATE_LEVEL_DOCS.md`\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;t8y2](https://redirect.github.com/t8y2) made their first\ncontribution in\n[#&#8203;186](https://redirect.github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/pull/186)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/blackbeam/rust_mysql_common/compare/v0.37.3...v0.38.0>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"before 8am on Friday\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you\nare satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/open-telemetry/otel-arrow).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4yNDkuMSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjI0OS4xIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiXX0=-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
